{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIyL1RoaXMlMjBJcyUyMFNwYXJrbGVob3JzZSUyMCUyODIwMjIlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"This Is Sparklehorse","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/bCx5KMcHu5H1GMeQX60CpVfkw48.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ijcV9hwbgCnAZFHlLD68buipUG1.jpg","description":"An comprehensive look at the life and music of Mark Linkous, a influential figure in the alternative music scene.  Critically-acclaimed Linkous had a dramatic life that saw him battle with drug and alcohol addiction, paralysis, and debilitating depression that resulted in his eventual suicide.  Mark's music was heralded by his peers and critics; a mix of delicate pop, discordant punk and melodic odyssey; it has been described as defiantly surrealist with all manner of references to smiling babies, organ music, birds, and celestial bodies.  The film mines Marks life and music and navigates the sacrifices and highs and lows of his art.\n\nReleased 12 Oct 2022 · United Kingdom · Language: English · 92 min\nStudio: Bo-Ho Films\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2022","genres":["Documentary","Music","Hollywood"],"imdb_id":"tt5114910","moviedb_id":413812,"tmdbId":413812,"runtime":"92 min","cast":["Mark Linkous","Angela Faye Martin","David Lowery","Gemma Hayes","David Lynch","Tom Waits","Thom Yorke","Jonathan Donahue"],"director":["Alex Crowton","Bobby Dass"],"writer":["Angela Faye Martin"],"released":"2022-10-12T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"The tragic tale of Mark Linkous, one of America's most influential cult artists. His life was lived with intensity and beauty. Mark Linkous was Sparklehorse","country":"United Kingdom","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Alex Crowton","character":"Director"},{"name":"Mark Linkous","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2HJTaFGG1OZMPJp8Ena7q4lFP0v.jpg"},{"name":"Angela Faye Martin","character":"Self"},{"name":"David Lowery","character":"Self